//RS 
//RS /// Fold one complete JSON value from the shared tokenizer event stream.
//RS ///
//RS /// Data rows and JSONL records use this same bounded tree fold. The caller
//RS /// supplies the first event because a data array has already consumed its
//RS /// opening delimiter; no adapter owns a second parser or an unbounded
//RS /// materialization fallback.
